   "kind": "board",
   "player": 0,
   "source": "hand-built",
   "why": "Five Gigs and one ready 8-power Unit. Attacking now steals one Gig, which is the biggest immediate gain on the board and is what a one-ply agent takes; it ends the turn on six. Equipping the +2 Gear first is worth almost nothing on the board, but it lifts the attacker to 10 power, and steal_count(10) is two Gigs, which is the game. The plan's A-then-C in its smallest honest form.",
